Changes made in this version (2026-09-30):

- Repackaged as a single skill directory with exactly one SKILL.md.
  The duplicated copy under skills/yomiyasu/ and the plugin and
  marketplace manifests of the original repository were removed so the
  directory can be loaded by any agent tool that reads SKILL.md.
- SKILL.md frontmatter was reduced to name and description. The
  argument hint was moved into the body (Step 1), and the lint command
  in Step 3 now resolves the script relative to the SKILL.md directory
  instead of a tool-specific environment variable, with python/py
  alternatives and a manual fallback.
- references/gemini-syntax.md was renamed to
  references/syntax-principles.md; its content is unchanged.
- scripts/yomiyasu_lint.py now forces UTF-8 output, accepts UTF-8 files
  with a BOM, and normalizes CRLF line endings, so it behaves the same
  on Windows, macOS and Linux.
- README, articles, evals, the benchmark corpus and its build scripts,
  and the logo image were not included.
- Unit tests (tests/) were added.

